  dialogue:
  - Dialogue: 'Allow me to explain this whole thing a little more... In a few moments,
      your life is about to begin! '
    Portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 69bff71eeb1dc104a8e5e86b81320fe1, type: 3}
    AnimatedReaction: {fileID: 0}
    AudioResponse: Neutral
  - Dialogue: "As you talk with your family, you\u2019ll have the option of playing
      6 different types of cards, with each card being a different \u201Cdialogue\u201D
      option."
    Portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 69bff71eeb1dc104a8e5e86b81320fe1, type: 3}
    AnimatedReaction: {fileID: 0}
    AudioResponse: Neutral
  - Dialogue: All dialogue cards have both a TONE (Witty, Sappy, Defensive), and
      an INTENT (Statement, Question). People react differently based on their personalities
      or situations.
    Portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 69bff71eeb1dc104a8e5e86b81320fe1, type: 3}
    AnimatedReaction: {fileID: 0}
    AudioResponse: Neutral
